From 09a5503dd8f1d9348357ee14eeea6bf4ff0a3fe8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bulatsaripov <b.sharipov@innopolis.university>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 23:08:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] Bound DeepSeek reasoning and raise the output budget for
 layer tasks

DeepSeek was reasoning on every run of the whole study. reasoning_effort was set
in opencode.json but never reached the API: a probe with it set to "none"
produced 12,433 reasoning tokens, and all 46 arms of the grid show 3-5x more
reasoning than output.

Unbounded reasoning is fatal at layer-task complexity. Measured against the API
with a GPT-2-block prompt:

    reasoning on,  8k cap : 8,192 reasoning,      0 chars, finish=length
    reasoning on, 32k cap : 32,767 reasoning,     0 chars, finish=length
    effort=none,   8k cap :      0 reasoning, 14,253 chars, finish=stop
    effort=low,    8k cap :  1,489 reasoning, 18,202 chars, finish=stop

So raising the cap does not help -- reasoning expands to fill it. That is why
both layer arms wrote no candidate under either documentation delivery, and why
the earlier read-starvation diagnosis was wrong: the binding constraint was the
output budget, not the prompt.

No opencode config path delivers the flag: model options.reasoning_effort is
ignored, provider-level makes opencode hang (exit 124), and the schema's model
 is also ignored (12,501 reasoning tokens). Bounded instead by
a local proxy that injects reasoning_effort into each request body; verified
end-to-end at 2,891 reasoning with 4,448 characters of output.

Also raises max_output_tokens 8192 -> 24576 and the session budget to 2400s.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 experiments/cute_ablation/best-gpt2.yaml | 9 +++++++--
 opencode.json                            | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/experiments/cute_ablation/best-gpt2.yaml b/experiments/cute_ablation/best-gpt2.yaml
index 2a285ab..374d014 100644
--- a/experiments/cute_ablation/best-gpt2.yaml
+++ b/experiments/cute_ablation/best-gpt2.yaml
@@ -13,13 +13,18 @@ agent:
   islands: 1
   # One arm per process; isolation is per-arm git worktrees.
   concurrency: 1
-  max_output_tokens: 8192
+  # Raised from 8192. DeepSeek's reasoning is not suppressible through any
+  # opencode config path (options.reasoning_effort ignored, provider-level
+  # hangs, model `reasoning: false` ignored), so it is bounded by a local
+  # proxy injecting reasoning_effort=low. Headroom still matters: unbounded
+  # reasoning consumed 8,192/8,192 and 32,767/32,768 with zero visible output.
+  max_output_tokens: 24576
   max_repairs_per_island: 0
   b300_seed: starter
   # Layer tasks need room to write. At 900s the agent spent the whole
   # session reading the 27-file bundle (52 reads, 40 steps) and never
   # wrote a kernel; the barrier then graded the untouched skeleton.
-  session_timeout_seconds: 1800
+  session_timeout_seconds: 2400
 evaluator:
   seed: 0
   warmup: 5
diff --git a/opencode.json b/opencode.json
index b15222d..c9c26ac 100644
--- a/opencode.json
+++ b/opencode.json
@@ -64,7 +64,7 @@
             "output": 32768
           },
           "options": {
-            "reasoning_effort": "none"
+            "reasoning_effort": "low"
           }
         }
       }
-- 
